is also symmetric.
 We then define 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
Q_{\boldsymbol{k}\boldsymbol{p}} & =\frac{1}{2}\frac{\partial f_{\boldsymbol{k}}}{\partial\epsilon_{\boldsymbol{k}}}\frac{\partial f_{\boldsymbol{p}}}{\partial\epsilon_{\boldsymbol{p}}}S\left(\boldsymbol{k},\boldsymbol{p}\right)\\
