 & =\frac{1}{2cD}\frac{\alpha^{2}}{Mc}\left(mk_{F}^{D-2}\right)\left(\frac{\nu}{ck_{F}}\right)^{D+1}\left[\frac{\overline{S_{D-1}}}{2\pi}\ \theta\left(2ck_{F}-\left|\nu\right|\right)\right]\left(1-\left(\frac{\nu}{2ck_{F}}\right)^{2}\right)^{\frac{D-3}{2}}\\
