 & -\frac{1}{\left(2\pi\right)^{2}}\int_{-\pi}^{0}\delta\left(\frac{\nu}{2ck_{F}}-\cos\left(-\varphi_{1}\right)\right)d\left(-\varphi_{1}\right)\\
